layable you'll still  get to use a few other familiar faces in  battle s support such as Android 18  Krillin and Yamcha last but not least  DLC although we've talked about quite a  bit of content so far there is already  confirmation of DLC for Kakarot future  two episodes with brand new stories and  a new story arc have already been teased  through the season pass and pre-order  bonuses so with that said it doesn't  look like there will be any shortage of  content after Kakarot release just in  case that rumored 80-plus our completion  time isn't enough for you and there's a  few things you should know before you  buy Dragon Ball Z Kakarot we hope this  video helps you decide if you'll be  getting your hands on this game and if  you enjoyed what you saw go ahead and  give us a like and a follow and be sure  to join us again here next time take  care
 

